{"arm": "vs", "model": "openai/gpt-6-luna", "i": 2, "finish": "stop", "dirs": [{"direction": "Calm editorial: warm paper tones, oversized serif headlines, and an airy weekly-planning preview that feels thoughtful and approachable.", "probability": 0.34}, {"direction": "Playful team workspace: bright colors, friendly geometric shapes, and a lively board of tasks that emphasizes collaboration.", "probability": 0.22}, {"direction": "Product-led dashboard: crisp typography, a dark navigation rail, and a detailed interactive-looking planner as the main event.", "probability": 0.18}, {"direction": "Coastal minimalism: sea-glass greens, soft blues, generous whitespace, and subtle wave-inspired details.", "probability": 0.16}, {"direction": "Bold typographic campaign: high-contrast color blocks, oversized sans-serif type, and punchy copy about making the week count.", "probability": 0.1}], "pick": {"direction": "Coastal minimalism: sea-glass greens, soft blues, generous whitespace, and subtle wave-inspired details.", "probability": 0.16}, "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#f5f8f5\">\n  <title>Tidepool \u2014 Make room for a good week</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      color-scheme: light;\n      --ink: #173b3b;\n      --muted: #6d8580;\n      --green: #317d70;\n      --green-dark: #24685e;\n      --mint: #dcece4;\n      --blue: #e4f0f2;\n      --sand: #f5f8f5;\n      --line: #e5ece7;\n      --white: #fff;\n      --shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(37, 81, 72, .12);\n    }\n\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: var(--sand);\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n\n    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }\n\n    .shell {\n      width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 48px));\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    .site-header {\n      height: 82px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n\n    .brand {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      font-size: 21px;\n      font-weight: 750;\n      letter-spacing: -.7px;\n    }\n\n    .brand-mark {\n      display: grid;\n      width: 34px;\n      height: 34px;\n      place-items: center;\n      border-radius: 11px;\n      background: var(--green);\n      color: white;\n    }\n\n    .brand-mark svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }\n\n    .nav-links {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 34px;\n      color: #5d7771;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 550;\n    }\n\n    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--green-dark); }\n\n    .nav-cta, .button {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      min-height: 44px;\n      padding: 0 19px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--green);\n      color: white;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 650;\n      transition: background .2s ease, transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;\n    }\n\n    .nav-cta:hover, .button:hover {\n      background: var(--green-dark);\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(36, 104, 94, .18);\n      transform: translateY(-1px);\n    }\n\n    .hero {\n      position: relative;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 56px;\n      padding: 74px 0 100px;\n      min-height: 620px;\n    }\n\n    .hero-copy { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n\n    .eyebrow {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 9px;\n      margin: 0 0 22px;\n      color: var(--green-dark);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 750;\n      letter-spacing: 1.25px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .eyebrow-dot {\n      width: 8px;\n      height: 8px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #7cb8a3;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #e2f0e8;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      max-width: 520px;\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 72px);\n      line-height: .99;\n      letter-spacing: -4.8px;\n      font-weight: 720;\n    }\n\n    h1 span {\n      color: var(--green);\n      font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      font-style: italic;\n      letter-spacing: -4px;\n    }\n\n    .hero-description {\n      max-width: 430px;\n      margin: 24px 0 29px;\n      color: #68807b;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 1.75;\n    }\n\n    .hero-actions {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 18px;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n    }\n\n    .hero-actions .button {\n      min-height: 50px;\n      padding: 0 23px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .text-link {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 7px;\n      color: #54736c;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 650;\n    }\n\n    .text-link:hover { color: var(--green-dark); }\n\n    .small-note {\n      margin: 17px 0 0;\n      color: #8a9b96;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .visual-wrap {\n      position: relative;\n      padding: 26px 0 20px 15px;\n    }\n\n    .visual-wrap::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 76%;\n      height: 88%;\n      top: 0;\n      right: -12px;\n      border-radius: 48% 52% 42% 58% / 42% 42% 58% 58%;\n      background: #e4f0eb;\n      transform: rotate(-7deg);\n    }\n\n    .sun-shape {\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 74px;\n      height: 74px;\n      top: -2px;\n      right: 6%;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #f2dfb6;\n      opacity: .8;\n    }\n\n    .app-window {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(218, 231, 223, .9);\n      border-radius: 17px;\n      background: white;\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n      transform: rotate(-1.2deg);\n    }\n\n    .app-topbar {\n      height: 48px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 18px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #edf1ed;\n      color: #99aaa4;\n      font-size: 11px;\n    }\n\n    .window-dots { display: flex; gap: 5px; }\n    .window-dots i { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #d8e3dc; }\n\n    .app-body { padding: 22px 22px 20px; }\n\n    .workspace-row {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .workspace-title {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: 720;\n      letter-spacing: -.5px;\n    }\n\n    .workspace-subtitle {\n      margin: 5px 0 0;\n      color: #8b9d97;\n      font-size: 11px;\n    }\n\n    .avatar-stack { display: flex; padding-left: 8px; }\n    .avatar {\n      width: 27px;\n      height: 27px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      margin-left: -7px;\n      border: 2px solid white;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      color: #416d62;\n      background: #dcece4;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      font-weight: 750;\n    }\n    .avatar:nth-child(2) { background: #f2e5cf; color: #8b7047; }\n    .avatar:nth-child(3) { background: #dce9f1; color: #52758a; }\n    .avatar:nth-child(4) { background: #e8dfed; color: #7b6484; }\n\n    .week-label {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      color: #8c9d97;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      font-weight: 650;\n      letter-spacing: .3px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .week-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);\n      gap: 7px;\n    }\n\n    .day {\n      min-height: 161px;\n      padding: 10px 7px;\n      border: 1px solid #edf1ed;\n      border-radius: 9px;\n      background: #fcfdfb;\n    }\n\n    .day.active {\n      border-color: #c8dfd3;\n      background: #f3f9f5;\n    }\n\n    .day-name {\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      color: #84958f;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .task {\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n      padding: 7px 6px;\n      border-radius: 5px;\n      background: #e6f1eb;\n      color: #477065;\n      font-size: 8px;\n      line-height: 1.3;\n      font-weight: 650;\n    }\n\n    .task.blue { background: #e9f1f4; color: #587887; }\n    .task.sand { background: #f7f0e4; color: #92794e; }\n    .task.purple { background: #f0ebf3; color: #77627f; }\n    .task small {\n      display: block;\n      margin-top: 4px;\n      opacity: .75;\n      font-size: 7px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n\n    .app-footer {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      margin-top: 17px;\n      padding-top: 14px;\n      border-top: 1px solid #edf1ed;\n      color: #879992;\n      font-size: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .progress {\n      width: 94px;\n      height: 5px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      border-radius: 99px;\n      background: #edf2ed;\n    }\n\n    .progress span {\n      display: block;\n      width: 62%;\n      height: 100%;\n      border-radius: inherit;\n      background: #78ad98;\n    }\n\n    .floating-note {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 2;\n      right: -25px;\n      bottom: 3px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 11px;\n      padding: 12px 15px;\n      border: 1px solid #e8eee8;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      background: white;\n      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(37, 81, 72, .11);\n      color: #42655b;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 650;\n    }\n\n    .check {\n      display: grid;\n      width: 25px;\n      height: 25px;\n      place-items: center;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #e0efe6;\n      color: #43826e;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .trust-row {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 28px;\n      padding: 23px 0 57px;\n      color: #8a9a94;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .trust-row strong {\n      color: #5e7770;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .trust-stars { color: #d6a960; letter-spacing: 2px; }\n\n    .section {\n      padding: 88px 0;\n      border-top: 1px solid #e8eeea;\n    }\n\n    .section-heading {\n      max-width: 600px;\n      margin: 0 auto 48px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .section-heading .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 14px; }\n\n    h2 {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 48px);\n      line-height: 1.1;\n      letter-spacing: -2px;\n      font-weight: 680;\n    }\n\n    .section-heading p {\n      margin: 16px 0 0;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n\n    .feature-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      gap: 18px;\n    }\n\n    .feature-card {\n      min-height: 225px;\n      padding: 25px;\n      border: 1px solid #e5ece7;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      background: rgba(255,255,255,.68);\n    }\n\n    .feature-icon {\n      display: grid;\n      width: 42px;\n      height: 42px;\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n      place-items: center;\n      border-radius: 13px;\n      background: var(--mint);\n      color: var(--green-dark);\n    }\n\n    .feature-icon.blue { background: var(--blue); color: #527b86; }\n    .feature-icon.sand { background: #f4ead8; color: #92764e; }\n    .feature-icon svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; }\n\n    .feature-card h3 {\n      margin: 0 0 9px;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      letter-spacing: -.3px;\n    }\n\n    .feature-card p {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: #738781;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.65;\n    }\n\n    .bottom-cta {\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      margin: 4px 0 82px;\n      padding: 57px 30px;\n      border-radius: 20px;\n      background: #e5f0e9;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .bottom-cta::before, .bottom-cta::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 250px;\n      height: 150px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(94, 148, 127, .16);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      transform: rotate(-20deg);\n    }\n\n    .bottom-cta::before { top: -90px; left: -50px; }\n    .bottom-cta::after { right: -60px; bottom: -100px; }\n\n    .bottom-cta > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n    .bottom-cta h2 { font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 43px); }\n    .bottom-cta p { margin: 13px 0 23px; color: #688079; font-size: 15px; }\n    .bottom-cta .button { min-height: 48px; }\n\n    footer {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 0 30px;\n      color: #91a099;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 22px; }\n    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--green-dark); }\n\n    @media (max-width: 900px) {\n      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 35px; padding-top: 55px; }\n      .hero-copy { max-width: 620px; }\n      .visual-wrap { width: min(100%, 650px); margin: 0 auto; }\n      .trust-row { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 13px 22px; }\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 620px) {\n      .shell { width: min(100% - 36px, 480px); }\n      .site-header { height: 70px; }\n      .nav-links { gap: 15px; }\n      .nav-links a:not(.nav-cta) { display: none; }\n      .nav-cta { min-height: 40px; padding: 0 15px; font-size: 13px; }\n      .hero { padding: 49px 0 66px; min-height: 0; }\n      h1 { font-size: clamp(47px, 13vw, 62px); letter-spacing: -3.8px; }\n      h1 span { letter-spacing: -3px; }\n      .hero-description { font-size: 15px; }\n      .visual-wrap { padding-left: 0; padding-right: 5px; }\n      .app-body { padding: 17px 12px 15px; }\n      .app-topbar { padding: 0 13px; }\n      .workspace-title { font-size: 16px; }\n      .week-grid { gap: 4px; }\n      .day { min-height: 142px; padding: 8px 4px; }\n      .task { padding: 6px 4px; font-size: 7px; }\n      .floating-note { right: -2px; bottom: -18px; }\n      .trust-row { padding: 38px 0 48px; font-size: 11px; }\n      .trust-row strong { font-size: 12px; }\n      .section { padding: 68px 0; }\n      .section-heading { margin-bottom: 32px; }\n      .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }\n      .feature-card { min-height: 0; padding: 22px; }\n      .feature-icon { margin-bottom: 17px; }\n      .bottom-cta { margin-bottom: 55px; padding: 43px 20px; }\n      footer { align-items: flex-start; gap: 18px; flex-direction: column; }\n    }\n\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }\n      *, *::before, *::after { transition-duration: .01ms !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"site-header shell\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Tidepool home\">\n      <span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M3 9.2c2.25 0 2.25-2 4.5-2s2.25 2 4.5 2 2.25-2 4.5-2 2.25 2 4.5 2M3 14c2.25 0 2.25-2 4.5-2s2.25 2 4.5 2 2.25-2 4.5-2 2.25 2 4.5 2M3 18.8c2.25 0 2.25-2 4.5-2s2.25 2 4.5 2 2.25-2 4.5-2 2.25 2 4.5 2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </span>\n      tidepool\n    </a>\n    <nav class=\"nav-links\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n      <a href=\"#how-it-works\">How it works</a>\n      <a href=\"#why-tidepool\">Why Tidepool</a>\n      <a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"#get-started\">Get started</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <section class=\"hero shell\">\n      <div class=\"hero-copy\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\"></span> A little clarity goes a long way</p>\n        <h1>Make room for a <span>good week.</span></h1>\n        <p class=\"hero-description\">\n          The calm, collaborative space for your team to figure out what matters\u2014and make a plan that feels doable.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n          <a class=\"button\" href=\"#get-started\">Plan your week <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;\u2192</span></a>\n          <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#how-it-works\">Take a peek <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2193</span></a>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small-note\">Free for small teams. No credit card, no fuss.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"visual-wrap\" aria-label=\"Preview of a shared Tidepool weekly plan\">\n        <span class=\"sun-shape\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <div class=\"app-window\">\n          <div class=\"app-topbar\">\n            <span class=\"window-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>\n            <span>tidepool.app / studio-team</span>\n            <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022\u2022\u2022</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"app-body\">\n            <div class=\"workspace-row\">\n              <div>\n                <h2 class=\"workspace-title\">The week ahead</h2>\n                <p class=\"workspace-subtitle\">A shared plan for 12\u201316 May</p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"avatar-stack\" aria-label=\"Four teammates\">\n                <span class=\"avatar\">ML</span>\n                <span class=\"avatar\">JR</span>\n                <span class=\"avatar\">AK</span>\n                <span class=\"avatar\">+2</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"week-label\"><span>Team calendar</span><span>May 2025</span></div>\n            <div class=\"week-grid\">\n              <div class=\"day\">\n                <div class=\"day-name\">Mon 12</div>\n                <div class=\"task\">Set the week<small>9:30 \u00b7 Everyone</small></div>\n                <div class=\"task blue\">Sketch concepts<small>11:00 \u00b7 Maya</small></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"day active\">\n                <div class=\"day-name\">Tue 13</div>\n                <div class=\"task sand\">Client check-in<small>10:00 \u00b7 Jules</small></div>\n                <div class=\"task\">Design review<small>14:00 \u00b7 Team</small></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"day\">\n                <div class=\"day-name\">Wed 14</div>\n                <div class=\"task purple\">Focus time<small>All day \u00b7 Alex</small></div>\n                <div class=\"task blue\">Share a draft<small>15:00 \u00b7 Maya</small></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"day\">\n                <div class=\"day-name\">Thu 15</div>\n                <div class=\"task\">Build it out<small>10:30 \u00b7 Jules</small></div>\n                <div class=\"task sand\">Team lunch<small>12:30 \u00b7 Everyone</small></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"day\">\n                <div class=\"day-name\">Fri 16</div>\n                <div class=\"task blue\">Wrap & reflect<small>14:00 \u00b7 Everyone</small></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"app-footer\">\n              <span>Week is taking shape</span>\n              <span class=\"progress\" aria-label=\"62 percent planned\"><span></span></span>\n              <span>62%</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"floating-note\"><span class=\"check\">\u2713</span> Everyone\u2019s on the same page</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"trust-row shell\" aria-label=\"Tidepool highlights\">\n      <strong>Made for teams that care about the work</strong>\n      <span class=\"trust-stars\" aria-label=\"five stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</span>\n      <span>Thoughtful planning, without the busywork</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"why-tidepool\">\n      <div class=\"shell\">\n        <div class=\"section-heading\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\"></span> Less scramble, more flow</p>\n          <h2>Good work starts with a little breathing room.</h2>\n          <p>Bring the moving pieces together, make space for focused work, and keep the whole team in the loop.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"feature-grid\">\n          <article class=\"feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"feature-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"5\" width=\"17\" height=\"15.5\" rx=\"2.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><path d=\"M8 3.5v3M16 3.5v3M3.5 9.5h17M8 13h3M8 16.5h7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>See the whole week</h3>\n            <p>Tasks, meetings, and priorities in one easy view\u2014so nothing gets lost in the scroll.</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"feature-icon blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 3.5c4.7 0 8.5 3.4 8.5 7.7 0 4.2-3.8 7.6-8.5 7.6-.9 0-1.8-.1-2.6-.4L4 20l1.6-4.4a7.2 7.2 0 0 1-2.1-4.4c0-4.3 3.8-7.7 8.5-7.7Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M8 11.5h.01M12 11.5h.01M16 11.5h.01\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Plan it together</h3>\n            <p>Make room for everyone\u2019s priorities and turn \u201cwe should\u201d into a plan you can share.</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"feature-icon sand\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 3.5v3M12 17.5v3M3.5 12h3M17.5 12h3M6 6l2.1 2.1M15.9 15.9 18 18M18 6l-2.1 2.1M8.1 15.9 6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4.1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3>Keep the pace human</h3>\n            <p>Balance ambitious plans with actual capacity. A good week should feel good, too.</p>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"how-it-works\">\n      <div class=\"shell\">\n        <div class=\"section-heading\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\"></span> A simple weekly ritual</p>\n          <h2>Get aligned. Then get going.</h2>\n          <p>Start with what matters, make a plan as a team, and let the week find its rhythm.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"feature-grid\">\n          <article class=\"feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"feature-icon\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span></div>\n            <h3>Bring your priorities</h3>\n            <p>Everyone adds what\u2019s on their plate before the week begins. No more guessing.</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"feature-icon blue\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span></div>\n            <h3>Find your team\u2019s flow</h3>\n            <p>Make a shared plan, spot the overlaps, and leave a little room to breathe.</p>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"feature-icon sand\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span></div>\n            <h3>Adjust as you go</h3>\n            <p>Plans change. Keep everyone in sync with a space that\u2019s easy to revisit.</p>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"bottom-cta shell\" id=\"get-started\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\"></span> Your week, a little clearer</p>\n      <h2>Let\u2019s make a good week together.</h2>\n      <p>Set up your team\u2019s Tidepool in minutes. The first week is on us.</p>\n      <a class=\"button\" href=\"mailto:hello@tidepool.